---
import { appPath } from '../lib/urls';

const loginUrl = appPath('/login');
---

<section class="py-32 relative z-10 border-y border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 via-white to-sky-50">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="animate-on-scroll slide-right">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-indigo-600 uppercase mb-4">Instagram × LINE</p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold font-['Outfit'] tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-6">
          Instagram で集客、<br />LINE でリピート。
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          BuzzItは「いいね数」ではなく、LINE友だち追加・来店・売上をKPIに設計されています。
          美容サロンや店舗ビジネスで最も効く導線を、毎朝5分のルーティンで回せます。
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-10">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-xs font-bold text-white">1</span>
            <span class="text-slate-700">Reels・ストーリーズ向けの台本をAIが自動生成</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-xs font-bold text-white">2</span>
            <span class="text-slate-700">プロフィールリンク→LINE登録の導線をテンプレ化</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-xs font-bold text-white">3</span>
            <span class="text-slate-700">投稿→LINE→来店までをダッシュボードで可視化</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a href={loginUrl} class="inline-block px-10 py-4 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          無料診断を始める
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="relative animate-on-scroll slide-left delay-200">
        <div class="rounded-[40px] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-2xl shadow-slate-200/60">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div class="h-12 w-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 via-pink-500 to-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold">IG</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">今日のミッション</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">春カラー施術のReels投稿</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 p-6 mb-4">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-2">キャプション案</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">【悲報】春カラー、予約が埋まりすぎて困ってます…。実は〇〇のお客様が8割。詳細はプロフィールのLINEから▼</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-center">
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 p-4">
              <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600">24.5K</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">リーチ</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-sky-50 p-4">
              <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-sky-600">124</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">LINE登録</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 p-4">
              <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-600">¥342K</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">推計売上</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
